      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SMART AS ROSE (8) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 0.8 lengths away in second (24.07) behind Paw Pascal at this track. The form from her last run stacks up well. Capable of going well again. MR. JONES (6) was out of the placings last time when fifth at Warrnambool (25.76) but scored three back at Ballarat (25.58). Goes very well here at the trip finding the frame in each of three starts. Comes through a solid form race last start. Likely to play a prominent role. WHOPPI DEVERE (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (23.84) last time in a Grade 5 at Horsham. Has a good record here at this journey. Key runner on best form. ANGRY CHIEF (3) can find the frame without surprising.",
